flowchart TD
    A[Authorized scan exports] --> B[Import CSV / XML]
    B --> C{Header valid?}
    C -- No --> X[Stop with error]
    C -- Yes --> D[Validate scope and field types]
    D --> E[Clean and normalize]
    E --> F[Write rejected rows with reasons]
    E --> G[Melt / cast as required]
    G --> H[Merge using documented keys]
    H --> I[Reconcile row counts]
    I --> J[Versioned export]
    J --> K[SHA-256 checksum and read-back]
    K --> L[Reports]
